{"id":"6f90a5c149724deb","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term-model.md","title":"项模型与基项模型","display":"df-term-model — 项模型与基项模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-term-model","aliases":["56-df-term-model"],"display":"df-term-model — 项模型与基项模型","depends_on":["[[56-thm-equational-congruence]]","[[56-df-quotient-algebra]]"],"source_section":"7.1.11","source_pages":"263","source_ocr_blocks":[284],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-model — 项模型与基项模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"949652e4222b24f5\" href=\"?note=949652e4222b24f5\" title=\"56-thm-equational-congruence\">56-thm-equational-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050e3997281664f2\" href=\"?note=050e3997281664f2\" title=\"56-df-quotient-algebra\">56-df-quotient-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.11"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"263"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>284</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"949652e4222b24f5\" href=\"?note=949652e4222b24f5\" title=\"56-thm-equational-congruence\">56-thm-equational-congruence</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G\\)</span> 及项构造运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_T,I_G\">\\(I_T,I_G\\)</span>。商构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050e3997281664f2\" href=\"?note=050e3997281664f2\" title=\"56-df-quotient-algebra\">56-df-quotient-algebra</a>。基项模型的定义域显式限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(G\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 的参数实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G)\\qquad(G\\ne\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G)\\qquad(G\\ne\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Notation 7.1.11；原书记作 T(Σ,E) 与 T₀(Σ,E)。本笔记把固定变量集保留为参数，区分开放项商和基项商。这里先构造代数；其确实满足E由后续命题证明，不能从名称“模型”推断。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.11，印刷页 263。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-equational-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"949652e4222b24f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-equational-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"050e3997281664f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-equational-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"949652e4222b24f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-thm-equational-congruence]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G$ 及项构造运算 $I_T,I_G$。商构造见 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]。基项模型的定义域显式限于 $G\\ne\\varnothing$ 的参数实例。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"050e3997281664f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-thm-equational-congruence]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G$ 及项构造运算 $I_T,I_G$。商构造见 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]。基项模型的定义域显式限于 $G\\ne\\varnothing$ 的参数实例。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,T,E,Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V},G,Q_G","display":false},{"tex":"I_T,I_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T,Q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Quot}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G,Q_G)\\qquad(G\\ne\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term-model.md]]"},{"id":"b2200b3a7e14635b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-term-model]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,E,T,Q,G,Q_G,I_T,I_G$。记 $\\mathbf{TM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(T/Q,I_Q)$；仅在 $G\\ne\\varnothing$ 时记 $\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。$\\operatorname{EqModels}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]；商投影、替换解释及同态解释交换式见本文件直接依赖。"}],"outgoing":["949652e4222b24f5","050e3997281664f2"]}